   "text": "I'm sorry your Green Bowl order was lost. Our delivery records show the courier picked it up at 5:58 PM, then reported that the bag was stolen from their bike before it reached you.\n\nI've sent a free replacement:\n\n- **Replacement order:** RP-900\n- **Items:** Harvest bowl and Green juice, the same as your original order\n- **Cost to you:** $0.00\n- **Estimated arrival:** 45\u201360 minutes\n- **Delivery address:** 58 Aspen Way, Oakdale, CA 94619\n\nSince you're getting a replacement, the original $28.03 charge for K-6303 stays in place. The $28.03 authorization hold from that order is already voided and will drop off your statement within 1\u20133 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with tonight?"
