   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, the replacement (RP-900) is going to **58 Aspen Way, Oakdale, CA 94619**, the same address as your original Green Bowl order.\n\nHere's everything we did tonight:\n\n1. **K-6301 (Lotus Garden):** I cancelled it and refunded the full $30.18 to your Visa ending in 4242. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n2. **K-6302 (Burger Barn):** The courier had already picked it up, so I couldn't change the address. It's still going to 58 Aspen Way.\n3. **K-6303 (Green Bowl):** I sent a free replacement (RP-900) to 58 Aspen Way. It should arrive in 45\u201360 minutes.\n\nThanks for your patience, Chloe, and enjoy your evening!"
  },
